@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="my-4 container">

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12">
            <h2 class="text-center text-decoration-underline">@ViewData["Title"]</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="col-sm-12 text-end">
            <a asp-controller="Invoice" asp-action="Index">
                Back to create bill
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>


    <hr />

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col">


            <h5>Effective Date: 2025-Jun-29</h5>

            <p>
                At  <strong>Free GST Bill</strong> (https://freegstbill.co.in), your privacy is a top priority.
                This Privacy Policy outlines how we handle your information when you use our free online invoice generator.
                By using the site, you agree to the terms described below.
            </p>

            <ol class="my-0">

                <li>
                    <h5 class="text-decoration-underline">No Personal Information is Collected</h5>
                    <p>
                        We do not collect, store, or share any personal data. You can use FreeGSTBill without creating an account, providing an email address, or entering any personally identifiable information (PII).
                    </p>
                </li>


                <li>
                    <h5 class="text-decoration-underline">Local Data Processing Only (No Server-Side Storage)</h5>
                    <p>
                        All invoice data you enter—such as company name, client name, amounts, items, taxes, etc.—is processed entirely within your browser. We do not transmit or store this information on our servers.
                        <br />
                        If you choose to use the auto-save feature, your invoice data may be temporarily saved in your browser's local storage, which is not accessible to us or anyone else. You can clear it anytime via your browser settings.
                    </p>
                </li>

                <li>
                    <h5 class="text-decoration-underline">Cookies and Tracking</h5>
                    <p class="my-0">
                        We do not use tracking cookies or collect usage behavior beyond basic, anonymous analytics.
                        <ul>
                            <li>
                                Necessary Cookies:
                                <br />
                                We may use minimal functional cookies to ensure the site works correctly (e.g., remembering light/dark mode, language preference).
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                Analytics (Optional):
                                <br />
                                We may use basic privacy-friendly analytics tools (such as Google Analytics with anonymized IP) to measure general usage—like the number of visits or popular pages.
                                No personal data is recorded or linked to individuals.
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </p>
                </li>

                <li>
                    <h5 class="text-decoration-underline">No Sharing or Selling of Data</h5>
                    <p>
                        Since we do not collect your data, we do not and cannot sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties.
                    </p>
                </li>

                <li>
                    <h5 class="text-decoration-underline">Data Security</h5>
                    <p>
                        Even though we do not store data, we use standard HTTPS encryption (SSL) to ensure all communication between your browser and our website is secure and protected from interception.
                    </p>
                </li>

                <li>
                    <h5 class="text-decoration-underline">Third-Party Links</h5>
                    <p>
                        Our website may contain links to third-party websites (e.g., resources, documentation, payment processors if added in the future). We are not responsible for their privacy practices. We encourage you to review their privacy policies before interacting with their content.
                    </p>
                </li>

                <li>
                    <h5 class="text-decoration-underline">Children's Privacy</h5>
                    <p>
                        FreeGSTBill is not intended for use by individuals under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect or store information from children.
                    </p>
                </li>

                <li>
                    <h5 class="text-decoration-underline">Third</h5>
                    <p>
                        FreeGSTBill is not intended for use by individuals under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect or store information from children.
                    </p>
                </li>

                <li>
                    <h5 class="text-decoration-underline">Compliance with Indian Law (and Global Best Practices)</h5>
                    <p class="my-0">
                        This Privacy Policy is compliant with applicable laws under the Information Technology Act, 2000 and its IT (Reasonable Security Practices and Procedures and Sensitive Personal Data or Information) Rules, 2011, as applicable in India.

                        <br />
                        We also align with international best practices such as:

                        <ul>
                            <li>
                                GDPR (General Data Protection Regulation – EU)
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                CCPA (California Consumer Privacy Act – US)
                            </li>
                        </ul>

                        Note: Since we do not collect data, most regulatory rights (access, correction, deletion) are inherently fulfilled by design.
                    </p>
                </li>

                <li>
                    <h5 class="text-decoration-underline">Changes to this Privacy Policy</h5>
                    <p>
                        We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Effective Date". Continued use of the site after updates constitutes your acceptance of the changes.
                    </p>
                </li>


                <li>
                    <h5 class="text-decoration-underline">Contact Us</h5>
                    <p>
                        If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, feel free to contact us:

                        <br />
                        Email: <a href="mailto:bizwithmohanrajput@gmail.com?subject=Free Invoice Feedback">bizwithmohanrajput@gmail.com</a>

                        <br />
                        Website: <a href="/">https://freegstbill.co.in</a>
                    </p>
                </li>

            </ol>

            <br />

            <strong>
                <code>Last Updated: 2025-Jun-29</code>
            </strong>


        </div>
    </div>

</div>